cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AutonomousVehicleControlBeginnersGuide"
abstract: >-
  Python sample programs and documents for learning autonomous driving
  algorithms. Each algorithm is implemented as simply as possible and runs
  in a 2D simulation, so localization, mapping, path planning, path tracking
  and perception can be studied one stage at a time.
authors:
